        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>expect, wait,</i> c. acc. et fut.
			inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλ᾽ αἰεί τινα φῶτα . . ἐδέγμην
